GREATER ILLUSIONS
'GREATER ILLUSIONS'

The greater illusion school of magic deals with illusions beyond the grasp
of most mages.  It consists of spells that fool others through sight and
sound.

More information on individual spells may be found by typing help
(spellname).  The enhancement spell group consists of the following spells:

improved invisibility   caster becomes invisible, but remains so even in
combat
blend                   caster blends with surroundings, remaining undetected
rainbow pattern         higher, more powerful version of color spray
false image             projects a false image of the caster into the room
imposter                the caster takes on the appearance of someone else
mirror image            creates multiple images of the caster
spook                   causes opponent to flee in terror
vacancy                 create the illusion that there is noone around
summon shadow           calls upon the casters shadow to defend them

This group is available to the following classes -
    ILLUSIONISTS
